<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Gentyre share disposal approved.</title>
<headline>Gentyre share disposal approved.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tyre manufacturer Gentyre Industries Ltd said on Wednesday that shareholders had approved the disposal by Gentyre of Tiger Wheels Holdings Ltd shares.</p>
<p>It gave no further details in a brief announcement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
